    {
      "id": 235873,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-03-09T19:09:39.860Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It amazes me they can still come up with surprising new things for characters like Wraith after all this time. You’d think they knew everything about her by now, but no!</p>\n<p>Oh my god, I just realized… They store KNYFE in the Block! XD I wonder if that’s why they called it that! I wouldn’t put it past them.</p>\n<p>The “no we cannot” music fakeout. XD</p>\n<p>Oh boy, that end blurb’s got me excited for future shenanigans. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 8,
